 "notes": "19 governorates. Halabja became the 19th governorate (law published in the Iraqi Gazette 5 May 2025; split from As Sulaymaniyah IQ-SU). ISO 3166-2:IQ has no code for it yet (the \"IQ-HA\" seen on some mirrors is unofficial), so it gets the non-ISO IQ-HALABJA. IQ-KR (Kurdistan Region) is a region containing AR/DA/SU/Halabja, not written as the governorate, so it is left out. latin = common English forms."
